    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "A generator represents an [`AudioUnit`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AudioToolbox/AudioUnit) of type `kAudioUnitType_Generator` or `kAudioUnitType_RemoteGenerator`.",
      "ko": "제너레이터는 `kAudioUnitType_Generator` 또는 `kAudioUnitType_RemoteGenerator` 유형의 [`AudioUnit`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AudioToolbox/AudioUnit)를 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "21def0d61cc617ec5176520cfa28dea70dffc8b641394c6d0a3a4ae1a6125c08",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "A generator has no audio input, but produces audio output.",
      "ko": "제너레이터는 오디오 입력이 없지만 오디오 출력을 생성합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4161d68aa8dfd83e6bdb1e9f38950b2d2879910e1cc189ef29639a2bfcc52bf5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0003",
      "source": "An example is a tone generator.",
      "ko": "예로 톤 제너레이터가 있습니다.",
